'''Wheels of Fate''' (運命の車輪（ロンド）, ''Unmei no Sharin（Rondo）'', '''Wheel of Fate (Rondo)''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (M): Cat Cannon will charge 15 seconds faster.

